{"name":"Vesuvius","hex":"#a85533","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Vesuvius","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A volcanic mountain located on the Gulf of Naples in Italy."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A kind of firework supposed to resemble a volcano eruption."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Vesuvius"}],"entries":[{"title":"Vesuvius (How I Met Your Mother)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Vesuvius\" is the nineteenth episode of the ninth season of the CBS sitcom How I Met Your Mother, and the 203rd episode overall. The episode features Ted in 2024, telling the Mother about the day of Robin and Barney's wedding. The final scene prompted some to think that the Mother was dead; this was proven correct in the series finale, \"Last Forever\"."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesuvius_(How_I_Met_Your_Mother)"},{"title":"Vesuvius (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Vesuvius is a Canadian metal band from Ottawa, Ontario. Formed in 2012, it currently consists of Ben Cooligan, Billy Melsness, Robin Parsons, Michael Luc Malo (guitars) and Carter Peak (drums)."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesuvius_(band)"},{"title":"Mount Vesuvius","blocks":[{"text":"Mount Vesuvius is a somma–stratovolcano located on the Gulf of Naples in Campania, Italy, about 9 km (5.6 mi) east of Naples and a short distance from the shore. It is one of several volcanoes forming the Campanian volcanic arc. Vesuvius consists of a large cone partially encircled by the steep rim of a summit caldera, resulting from the collapse of an earlier, much higher structure."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Il_cratere_del_Vulcano_-_panoramio.jpg/330px-Il_cratere_del_Vulcano_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Vesuvius"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Naples_from_the_Castello_Sant_Elmo_